Feature: progress-first-show
Target module: ProgressIndicator

- Fix: the first linear bar shown in a page jumped straight to its first stop without
  animating, and a style 3 bar then stayed there (no transitionend, so no slow or crawl
  phase). setTemplate() now flushes styles after inserting a new bar, as the reuse branch
  already did.

Why: found by the features-validator on Apps/vilshub.net's route loading bar (a visitor's first
navigation always showed a static bar).

Verified: headless Chromium on vilshub.net with a 3s fragment delay: first bar 0% -> 34% at
400ms -> 65% halted at 1.2s -> 75% at 2.5s, completed on mount.
